Third-party runtime dependencies
================================================================================

The following packages are included as runtime dependencies. Licenses were
verified from installed package metadata (dist-info).

  mcp — MIT
  pydantic — MIT
  pydantic-settings — MIT
  uvicorn — BSD-3-Clause
  starlette — BSD-3-Clause
  psycopg[binary,pool] — GNU LGPL v3
  prometheus-client — Apache-2.0
  opentelemetry-api — Apache-2.0
  opentelemetry-sdk — Apache-2.0
  opentelemetry-exporter-otlp-proto-grpc — Apache-2.0
  opentelemetry-instrumentation-asgi — Apache-2.0

The observability extras (prometheus-client, opentelemetry-*) are optional
and guard all imports behind runtime availability checks; the server runs
without them if absent.

